Summary:
Today’s session involved continuing the frontend development of the Multi-Vendor E-commerce Platform with a focus on adding more functionality to the existing components. Work was done on handling user interactions such as basic form inputs and improving navigation flow across pages. Efforts were also made to prepare the frontend for integration by structuring components to handle dynamic data.

Outcomes:
The frontend became more interactive with improved handling of user inputs and navigation. Components were better structured to support upcoming backend integration. This progress brought the application closer to a functional state, setting up the next step of connecting APIs and displaying real data.
